679 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 314 0 R
/E (The core problem was never the architecture, it was the adversarial training dynamics. Every fix to one side created a new imbalance on the other. DDPM eliminated this entirely by reformulating generation as a single-network denoising regression.)
/Pg 50 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
680 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 314 0 R
/E (Two factors drove the DDPM's success: a fundamentally more stable training paradigm, and tighter data via MTCNN face cropping \(28,786 / 30,000 images, removing noisy backgrounds\).)
/Pg 50 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
